CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/s com/corrodinggames/rts/game/TeamUnitCaches
	COMMENT TeamUnitCaches - the aggregate statistics a Team keeps about its units, updated from onUnitAdded(Unit)/onUnitRemoved(Unit) as units are created/destroyed. Fields: unitCapCount (how many units the team currently counts against its unit cap: every unit whose UnitTypeInterface.ignoreInUnitCapCalculation() is false, whether finished or still under construction, plus every factory build-queue entry; compared against unitsMax by OrderableUnit.tryBuildUnit, by UnitTypeList.spawnInto, by FactoryBuildQueue.queueOrCancel and by the UI), builtCount (finished units, buildProgress >= 1), inProgressCount (units still under construction, buildProgress < 1), totalCount (all units), queuedBuildCount (entries in the factories' build queues), totalValue (sum of every unit's getGenerationCredits()), resourceTotal / resourceGained / resourceLost (StoredResources accumulations from the units' consumed resources), costPositive / costNegative (the positive and negative parts of every unit's total price), hasSeenCreditsUsingUnitType (sticky flag set when a real, non-virtual unit whose UnitTypeInterface.usesCredits() is true enters the team), unitsCreditsValue / buildingsCreditsValue (credits-equivalent value of the operational units, split by UnitTypeInterface.isBuilding()), tagCountList / tagCounts (TeamUnitCachesTagCountList) and unitsMax (the team's unit cap, default 5, overwritten by Team from GameEngine). Naming note: unitCapCount was earlier called buildingCount, which read as "number of buildings" although it counts every unit that occupies unit capacity, queued build entries included. CORRECTION: hasSeenCreditsUsingUnitType was earlier called hasSeenNonMobileUnitType - that was wrong; the guard is UnitTypeInterface.usesCredits() (true when a CustomUnitMetadata's parsed prices carry a non-zero credits component, set by CustomUnitMetadata.checkPriceUsesCredits), not a mobility check. [field names derived from this class' update logic]
	FIELD a unitsMax I
	FIELD b unitCapCount I
	FIELD c builtCount I
	FIELD d totalCount I
	FIELD e queuedBuildCount I
	FIELD f inProgressCount I
	FIELD g totalValue I
	FIELD h resourceTotal Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/f;
	FIELD i resourceGained Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/f;
	FIELD j resourceLost Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/f;
	FIELD k costPositive Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/f;
	FIELD l costNegative Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/e/f;
	FIELD m hasSeenCreditsUsingUnitType Z
	FIELD n unitsCreditsValue I
	FIELD o buildingsCreditsValue I
	FIELD p tagCountList Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/t;
	FIELD q tagCounts Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/t;
	METHOD a onUnitAdded (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)V
	METHOD a getTagCount (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/g;)Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/p;
	METHOD a addQueuedTagCounts (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/d/l;)V
	METHOD b onUnitRemoved (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)V
	METHOD b removeQueuedTagCounts (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/d/l;)V
	METHOD c addTagCounts (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)V
	METHOD d removeTagCounts (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)V
